Domain-specific AUC ranked as: flexibility 0.75 (95% CI 0.71-0.78), speed-agility 0.69 (95% CI 0.65-0.72), overall 0.66 (95% CI 0.63-0.69), CRF 0.65 (95% CI 0.62-0.69), and muscular fitness 0.64 (95% CI 0.61-0.67; Table 4
                        , Fig. 1
                        ). The flexibility AUC was significantly higher than the overall AUC (paired bootstrap difference = 0.09, standard error [SE] = 0.02, z = 3.82, p < 0.001). At the IFIS ≤ 3 vs ≥ 4 rule, sensitivity ranged from 0.68 (muscular) to 0.83 (flexibility) and specificity from 0.48 (CRF) to 0.60 (speed-agility).
